  {
   "type": "p",
   "parts": [
    "This is part of my family. Everything revolves around them, because their cheerful nature, affection and energy sweep you along with them. Sharing my life with them has changed it completely. Through them, I have learned to appreciate their finest qualities, especially their temperament and beauty. I never tire of admiring them."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "divider"
  },
