   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "parts": [
    "Another truly beautiful thing is the bond they share. They are an inseparable group in which each has a role to play. I also treasure their company, which is so pleasant and comforting. I spend many hours of my life with them and would spend even more if I had the time."
   ]
